        "id": "ch10_2_6-1",
        "text": "API\nThe business logic layer in web applications can be consumed by additional clients. For\nexample, a mobile app can use the same business logic for a limited or same set of features.\nFor Business to Business ( B2B ) applications, a remote application can submit requests to\nthe business logic layer directly. This is all possible if we expose standard interfaces such\nas a REST API for our business logic layer. In the current era, accessing the business logic\nlayer through an API is a best practice to make the API ready from day one.",
